From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: qcs8550-ayaneo: drop the SDHCI capability mask, fix PCIe WAKE# polarity, codec rail sleep mode, and drop the dead thermal-zone overrides

